<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-067-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.325221" lon="-120.914591"><name>SC26-067-C</name><cmt>SC26-067</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.9 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 29/100; not catch probability. Center 177 ft; nearby 170–189 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Parallel bands visible in survey rendering; confirm small-scale relief by sonar. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-048</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.32600337386407" lon="-120.91550600052227"/><trkpt lat="35.32510038025917" lon="-120.91541918963254"/><trkpt lat="35.325156336858036" lon="-120.91343775777523"/><trkpt lat="35.324795898434516" lon="-120.91344702281793"/><trkpt lat="35.32479020317688" lon="-120.91311717164135"/><trkpt lat="35.32497042235385" lon="-120.91311253840954"/><trkpt lat="35.325139248161406" lon="-120.91244820013696"/><trkpt lat="35.32540957679365" lon="-120.91244124795729"/><trkpt lat="35.32542097027042" lon="-120.91310095515007"/><trkpt lat="35.32569509606678" lon="-120.91331390828189"/><trkpt lat="35.325702688996266" lon="-120.91375371482708"/><trkpt lat="35.32552246976745" lon="-120.91375834676131"/><trkpt lat="35.325439951406445" lon="-120.91420046796054